## Medium Severity (worth fixing but not blocking)

### 14. Testing architecture gaps
- **Shadow-class tests** (reimplementing `TestRulesEngine`, `TestStatusSystem` from scratch rather than testing real code) give false confidence — ~200 lines of mock code that nobody maintains. The real classes are now pure C# and testable directly.
- **28 services have no interfaces** — can't substitute or mock. `EffectPipeline` needs 12 real services to exercise full code paths.
- **26 UI model tests permanently skipped** — models inherit `RefCounted`, which requires Godot runtime.
- **`AIDecisionPipeline` does `as CombatContext` downcast** at AIDecisionPipeline.cs, silently getting `null` when running against test `HeadlessCombatContext`.

### 15. BG3SpellParser inheritance is manual (35 of 75 fields)
`BG3SpellParser.ApplyInheritance` copies ~35 fields manually. `BG3SpellData` has ~75. Adding a field silently breaks inheritance for that field. No compile-time enforcement.

### 16. Shared mutable combatant list
`CombatArena._combatants` (`List<Combatant>`) is passed by reference to 6+ services. Any service can observe or cause mutations mid-frame. Between `.Clear()` and `.AddRange()` during scenario reload, any holder sees an empty list.

